{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56516","headline":"巨胜歌（幷序） 五 · 柳冲用","name":"巨胜歌（幷序） 五","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"二八成两家，中弦敌二八。\n乃知天地间，阴阳制枢辖。\n子因母而生，母因子而杀。\n长养婴孩精，温颜防利滑。\n月满每成形，抽添还暂歇。\n壬子一阳生，循环至玄绝。\n若知出世期，神符与白雪。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"柳冲用","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56516.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56516","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}